WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.940
- I just saw this video of you

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.230
you posted of your baby girl.

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:05.090
We're gonna show it.

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:05.923
(audience moans)

00:00:05.923 --> 00:00:07.143
She's super cute.

00:00:08.057 --> 00:00:09.306
(audience claps)

00:00:09.306 --> 00:00:10.360
- [Alex] Oh, thank you.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.010
She had so much fun.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:13.330
She's a water baby.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:14.490
- I love that.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:15.400
I love the water.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.390
I think it feels rejuvenating.

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:20.010
So any sign she's gonna be into soccer?

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:24.400
- Oh, well she better, you know,
no pressure, but we'll see.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.010
I keep putting a soccer
ball in front of her

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:27.430
and she wants nothing to do with it.

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:28.820
So hopefully one day.

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:32.020
- Well, how is your prep for
the Tokyo Olympics going?

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:33.020
- Oh, it's good.

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:38.020
I mean, we are in like full
prep mode and, you know,

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:41.690
on the field every single day,
getting ready and obviously

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:44.040
you know, looking forward to it so much.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.930
And for me, I kind of get a second chance

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:47.466
because it would have been really close

00:00:47.466 --> 00:00:49.540
to after having my daughter last year.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.758
So now pushing it to this year,

00:00:51.758 --> 00:00:54.450
I'm really excited for
that second opportunity.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:55.950
- [Kelly] Yeah, silver lining.

